cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Global Energy Regime Awareness"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18266407"
authors:
  - family-names: Loswin
    given-names: Nawder
abstract: >
  Global Energy Regime Awareness is a descriptive framework for expressing
  operating regimes, validity assumptions, and boundary semantics within
  large-scale energy systems. The work demonstrates how structural context
  can be declared using existing operational surfaces without altering
  grid control, dispatch, or regulatory mechanisms.
keywords:
  - energy systems
  - grid operations
  - regime modeling
  - infrastructure resilience
  - operational clarity
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/umaywant2/TriadicFrameworks
